\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The head-to-head, visualized.} Each point is one audited math configuration; the $y$ axis is its scoreboard inflation under best-of-64 pressure. Left: raw agreement with human soundness places the sabotaged frontier judge inside the failed-blind cluster. Right: the style partial isolates both style-loaded configurations in a sign-anchored conviction region fixed before outcomes. \textbf  {Takeaway: naive validation ranks but cannot diagnose; the audit's nuisance axis separates capable-corrupt from weak-honest.}}}{6}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h2h}{{2}{6}{\textbf {The head-to-head, visualized.} Each point is one audited math configuration; the $y$ axis is its scoreboard inflation under best-of-64 pressure. Left: raw agreement with human soundness places the sabotaged frontier judge inside the failed-blind cluster. Right: the style partial isolates both style-loaded configurations in a sign-anchored conviction region fixed before outcomes. \textbf {Takeaway: naive validation ranks but cannot diagnose; the audit's nuisance axis separates capable-corrupt from weak-honest.}}{figure.caption.9}{}}
